   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1.)POD#0 - Low UOP->bolused 1L NS with good effect, AMS \nchange->dilaudid PCA switched to dilaudid IV 0.25mg q3H, neuro \nexam non-focal.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=19624872-DS-14:chars=2055-2191",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "2.)POD#1 - Triggered for acute MS changes/paranoia-> neurology \nc/s->recs chem10, TSH, B12, LFTs, U/A, all labs wnl, head",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=19624872-DS-14:chars=2194-2315",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CT->neg for ICH.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=19624872-DS-14:chars=2317-2333",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Decreased oral pain medication dose->recovered.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=19624872-DS-14:chars=2334-2381",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Otherwise, pain was initially controlled with a PCA followed by \na transition to oral pain medications on POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=19624872-DS-14:chars=2385-2497",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient had \na IVC filter placed for PE prophylaxis pre-operatively.",
